{"type":"Film","id":"FR2015_172","slug":"fr2015-172-cosmos","title":{"native":"Cosmos","english":"Cosmos"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2015-12-09","year":2015},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"Andrzej Zulawski","slug":"andrzej-zulawski","name":"Andrzej Zulawski","birthYear":1940,"deathYear":2016,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Poland","awards":[]}],"genre":["Drama"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/68/83/152388/format_page/cosmos.jpg","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zSwrla3xco8"},"synopsis":{"native":"Witold a raté ses examens de droit et Fuchs vient de quitter son emploi dans une boite de mode parisienne. Ils vont passer quelques jours près de la mer et des montagnes, dans une pension dite de famille, où les accueille un moineau pendu dans la forêt, puis un bout de bois tout aussi pendu, puis une série de signes au plafond et dans le jardin, indiquant une volonté et une direction.","english":"Witold has failed his law exams and Fuchs has just quit his job in Parisian fashion company. They'll go and spend a few days by the sea and in the mountains, in a so-called \"boarding house.\" When they arrive, they are greeted by a hanged sparrow in the forest, followed by a piece of wood, also hanged, then by a series of signs on the ceiling and in the garden, indicating instructions and the direction to take."},"production":[{"country":"France","share":"Majority coproducer"},{"country":"Portugal","share":"Minority coproducer"}],"characters":[{"id":"FR2015_172_01","film":"FR2015_172","person":{"id":"Sabine Azéma","slug":"sabine-azema","name":"Sabine Azéma","birthYear":1949,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"age":"3: Third Age (60-75)","gender":"Female identifying","sexuality":"Heterosexual","origin":"White Western European","class":"Upper class","profession":"Retired","ability":"Able-bodied","assistedMobility":"No"},{"id":"FR2015_172_02","film":"FR2